        "answer": "No, you can't.",
        "question": "When my opponent activated this card's [On Play][When Digivolving] effect, my Digimon with a play cost of 9 or less digivolved in my next turn and became a Digimon with a play cost of 10 or more. Can I attack with this Digimon?",
